BIG PROBLEMS AND THAT IS IF HE

00:09:30.964 --> 00:09:32.799
RUNS AS A LIBERTARIAN NOMINEE

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.434
FOR A PRESIDENT AND HE SAYS THAT

00:09:34.435 --> 00:09:35.735
IS A POSSIBILITY.

00:09:35.736 --> 00:09:36.502
WE KNOW THAT HE COMES FROM A KEY

00:09:36.503 --> 00:09:39.906
STATE THAT THIRD PARTY

00:09:39.907 --> 00:09:41.174
CANDIDATES DO NOT HAVE TO GET A

00:09:41.175 --> 00:09:43.109
LOT OF VOTES TO AFFECT THE

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:45.344
OUTCOME AND THAT MATTER IN

00:09:45.345 --> 00:09:46.312
MICHIGAN.

00:09:46.313 --> 00:09:49.882
&gt;&gt; THIS COULD BE A CRACK IN THE

00:09:49.883 --> 00:09:51.217
DAMP, SOMETHING THAT WOULD BUILT

00:09:51.218 --> 00:09:52.285
INTO SOMETHING MUCH BIGGER AND

00:09:52.286 --> 00:09:52.319
THAT

00:09:53.487 --> 00:09:54.921
DOES NOT APPEAR TO BE HAPPENING

00:09:54.922 --> 00:09:57.123
AT ALL AND OF COURSE THE BIGGER

00:09:57.124 --> 00:09:58.758
ISSUES AS A SENATE AND BIT

00:09:58.759 --> 00:10:00.426
ROMNEY FOR GOODNESS' SAKES SAID

00:10:00.427 --> 00:10:02.996
HE DID NOT AGREE

